Package: aquaTrajectories
Title: Aquatic Animal Movement and Multiview Trajectories
Version: 0.0.24.9000
Authors@R: person("Stefanos", "Balaskas", email = "56984563+stefanosbalaskas@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Development-stage tools for validated two- and three-dimensional aquatic animal trajectories, movement and group metrics, event alignment, synchronization, and calibrated stereo geometry and observed 3D voxel occupancy, reviewer-gated cross-view hypotheses, and conditional pixel-error propagation. Automatic cross-camera fish identity matching, fish detection, independently metrology-certified underwater accuracy, and measurement-error-calibrated inference are not yet implemented.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils, graphics, grDevices, tools
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), rgl, roxygen2, fdapace, nlme
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
URL: https://github.com/stefanosbalaskas/AquaTrajectories
BugReports: https://github.com/stefanosbalaskas/AquaTrajectories/issues
